    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d719">

                <pb facs="0814" n="726" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg726"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Count Cassini to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-30"><hi rendition="#italic">March 30,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: By order of my
                    Government, I have the honor to inform your excellency that the following
                    announcement has just been made by the commander in chief of the Russian fleet
                    in the Pacific Ocean:</p>
                <p>“Any public or merchant vessel navigating waters in which military operations are
                    carried on and detected at night without ship lights on board or by day without
                    a flag, and which, after warning by the firing of a gun, will not show its
                    colors, will be considered to be an enemy, and sunk.”</p>
                <p>Be pleased, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Count Cassini.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
